  {
    "chunk": "2. Now, plug this result back into \\( f \\) to compute \\( f(f(x)) \\):\n   \\( f\\left( \\frac{1 + x}{1 - 3x} \\right) = \\frac{1 + \\left( \\frac{1 + x}{1 - 3x} \\right)}{1 - 3 \\left( \\frac{1 + x}{1 - 3x} \\right)} \\)",
